<p>Whether you need a <strong>luxury interior designer in Bangalore</strong> for a villa, an <strong>affordable interior designer in Bangalore</strong> for a 2BHK apartment, or a specialist for modular kitchens and wardrobes, this guide breaks down exactly what each firm is best at — so you can shortlist with confidence.</p>
