<p><strong>Style:</strong> Bespoke, minimal luxury<strong>Best for:</strong> High-budget dream homes<strong>Experience:</strong> 15+ years</p>
<p>Founded by former IT professionals who wanted a more systematic approach to design, The KariGhars has grown into one of Bangalore's most recognised names for ultra-premium interiors. The studio's tagline, "Design. Build. Deliver," reflects its turnkey philosophy — combining a tech-driven process with artisanal woodcraft to deliver elegant, minimalist spaces with a lifetime materials warranty.</p>
