<h2>How to Choose the Right Interior Designer in Bangalore</h2>
<p>With 500+ firms operating across the city, picking the right partner comes down to five checks:</p>
<p><strong>1. Experience:</strong> Prefer studios with 5+ years of verifiable project history. <br> <strong>2. Portfolio depth:</strong> Review at least 20–30 completed projects, not just hero shots. <br> <strong>3. Pricing transparency:</strong> Insist on an itemised BOQ with material brand names — not a lump-sum quote. <br> <strong>4. Warranty terms:</strong> Carpentry warranties typically run 1–10 years; electrical work is usually 1 year. <br> <strong>5. Site visits:</strong> Always visit 2–3 live or completed sites before signing a contract.</p>
